# Licensed BADA 4 TO/LD bank/load REPORT and ENFORCE gate.
# Run with: IC research/pybada-envelope-terminal
00:00:00.00>ECHO TEST INFO === PYBADATEM TERMINAL LATERAL ENVELOPE GATE ===
00:00:00.05>ECHO TEST INFO This gate uses the licensed-observed TO and LD operating points.
00:00:00.10>ECHO TEST EXPECT TOR and TOE remain TO with HLid 3 and gear up.
00:00:00.15>ECHO TEST EXPECT LDR and LDE remain LD with HLid 5 and gear down.
00:00:00.20>ECHO TEST EXPECT All four use DLM nf3/nf1 and a bank maximum near 60 degrees.
00:00:00.25>ECHO TEST ERROR Stop if any configuration differs before the turns.
00:00:00.30>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.35>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.40>PERFMODEL BADA4
00:00:01.00>CRE TOR,A320-232,41.300,2.100,90,200,140
00:00:01.05>CRE TOE,A320-232,41.310,2.100,90,200,140
00:00:01.10>CRE LDR,A320-232,41.330,2.100,90,1000,140
00:00:01.15>CRE LDE,A320-232,41.340,2.100,90,1000,140
00:00:01.20>DYNAMICS TOR KINEMATIC
00:00:01.25>DYNAMICS TOE KINEMATIC
00:00:01.30>DYNAMICS LDR KINEMATIC
00:00:01.35>DYNAMICS LDE KINEMATIC
00:00:01.40>BADACONFIG TOR PYBADA
00:00:01.45>BADACONFIG TOE PYBADA
00:00:01.50>BADACONFIG LDR PYBADA
00:00:01.55>BADACONFIG LDE PYBADA
00:00:01.60>ALT TOR 5000 1500
00:00:01.65>ALT TOE 5000 1500
00:00:01.70>ALT LDR 0 -500
00:00:01.75>ALT LDE 0 -500
00:00:01.80>BANK TOR 70
00:00:01.85>BANK TOE 70
00:00:01.90>BANK LDR 70
00:00:01.95>BANK LDE 70
00:00:02.00>ENVELOPECHECKS TOR CUSTOM BANK_ANGLE LOAD_FACTOR
00:00:02.05>ENVELOPECHECKS TOE CUSTOM BANK_ANGLE LOAD_FACTOR
00:00:02.10>ENVELOPECHECKS LDR CUSTOM BANK_ANGLE LOAD_FACTOR
00:00:02.15>ENVELOPECHECKS LDE CUSTOM BANK_ANGLE LOAD_FACTOR
00:00:02.20>ENVELOPE TOR REPORT
00:00:02.25>ENVELOPE TOE ENFORCE
00:00:02.30>ENVELOPE LDR REPORT
00:00:02.35>ENVELOPE LDE ENFORCE
00:00:02.40>RECORDRESEARCH START pybada-envelope-terminal.csv
00:00:02.50>PERFSTATUS TOR BOUNDS
00:00:02.60>PERFSTATUS TOE BOUNDS
00:00:02.70>PERFSTATUS LDR BOUNDS
00:00:02.80>PERFSTATUS LDE BOUNDS
00:00:03.00>ECHO TEST EXPECT No QUALITY event yet because effective bank is zero outside a turn.
00:00:04.00>ECHO TEST ACTION Commanding all aircraft from heading 90 to 270 with a requested 70-degree bank.
00:00:04.10>HDG TOR 270
00:00:04.15>HDG TOE 270
00:00:04.20>HDG LDR 270
00:00:04.25>HDG LDE 270
00:00:08.00>PERFSTATUS TOR ALL
00:00:08.10>PERFSTATUS TOE ALL
00:00:08.20>PERFSTATUS LDR ALL
00:00:08.30>PERFSTATUS LDE ALL
00:00:08.40>RECORDRESEARCH STOP
00:00:08.50>ECHO TEST INFO Run validate_terminal_lateral_run.py on output/pybada-envelope-terminal.csv.
00:00:25.00>ECHO TEST EXPECT Each REPORT trail turns more tightly than its ENFORCE counterpart.
00:00:28.00>HOLD
